Verse 1:
[Bb]O Lord my God! when I in [Eb]awesome wonder
[Eb]Consider [Bb]all the [F]works Thy [F7]hands have [Bb]made,
[Bb]I see the stars, I hear the [Eb]mighty thunder,
[Eb]Thy pow'r thro'[Bb]out the [F]uni[F7]verse dis[Bb]played.
[Bb]Then sings my soul, my [Eb]Saviour God to [Bb]Thee;
[Bb]How great Thou [F]art, how [F7]great Thou [Bb]art!
[Bb]Then sings my soul, my [Eb]Saviour God to [Bb]Thee;
[Bb]How great Thou [F7]art, How great Thou [Bb]art!

